.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-reset 1 "" "Sway Things 0.0.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-reset \- Remove the stored value of a setting and apply its default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things reset\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-overwrite\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the stored value of a setting and apply its default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<IDENTIFIER>\fR
The input device, by its identifier as `swaymsg \-t get_inputs` shows it
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Reset a setting that can lock you out without asking to keep it
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
Replace generated files that were changed outside Sway Things
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
The setting, e.g. windows.gaps.inner
